   "line": [
    "bxc6"
   ],
   "spoken": "Recapture with the pawn, bxc6, not the knight — it hits the bishop and pushes it back with tempo, which is the whole engine of Black's initiative here.",
   "kind": "main",
   "teaches": "Recapture with the pawn that gains a tempo on an enemy piece, keeping the initiative rolling."
  },
  {
   "ply": 15,
