   "line": [
    "Be2"
   ],
   "spoken": "The compensation is hard to see — our pawns are ruined and the a5-knight looks offside — but it's real: White's g5-knight is stranded and his pieces are undeveloped. We have to keep the pressure on before he untangles.",
   "kind": "main",
   "teaches": "Compensation for a pawn lives in the opponent's loose pieces and lost time, not in your own pretty structure."
