   "spoken": "And the move works on two levels: even where it doesn't win outright, it forces concessions — depriving White's knight of a developing square and clearing the diagonal for our own bishop. One move, several purposes.",
   "kind": "main",
   "teaches": "Prize multi-purpose moves that both attack and induce concessions across the position.",
