   "line": [
    "c5"
   ],
   "spoken": "Concretely, c5 undermines the base holding that knight up. Remember LPDO — loose pieces drop off — a piece defended by no pawn is a tactic waiting to happen, and c5 is aimed at rendering the knight loose.",
